 (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy"/></div><h6 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-1109_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1111_">Highest Quality Control</span></h6></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-107f" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-1112_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:884px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-1113_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-1114_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-1115_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1117_">FAQs</span></h3><div class="sc-dExXmK dxVHbk pf-1118_ accordion_block pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-1119_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-1120_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="c9bb5df8-73ca-4456-8404-59ef7f611505" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Is ThePhotoStick® Omni X easy to use?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="c9bb5df8-73ca-4456-8404-59ef7f611505" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-1122_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-1123_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1125_">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href="https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/" target="_blank">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick&nbsp;Omni X. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-1126_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-1127_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="be0d0667-4dae-401f-8437-3bd4ae3decda" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="be0d0667-4dae-401f-8437-3bd4ae3decda" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-1129_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-1130_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1132_">Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- macOS: macOS X 10.13 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 8.0 and later<br><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href="/pages/support-system-requirements" target="_self">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-1133_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-1134_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="066159a8-3c42-4a1c-a778-4cb9c33aa956" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="066159a8-3c42-4a1c-a778-4cb9c33aa956" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-1136_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-1137_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1139_">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>16GB - 6,400 photos<br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-1140_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-1141_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="f1062030-5751-4ace-b018-7b9b61cd3634" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video files types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X find and save?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f1062030-5751-4ace-b018-7b9b61cd3634" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-1143_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-1144_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-1146_">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MPEG4, but it also saves a vast array of file types as listed below:<br><br><b>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:<br></b>- JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>- HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>- GIF (*.gif)
- PNG (*.png)<br>- BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>- TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)<br>- ICO (*.ico)<br>- Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw)<br>- Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>- PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><b>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</b><br>- MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>- MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>- AVI (*.avi)<br>- WMV (*.wmv)<br>
